could easily spend hours organizing, saving, and backing up your data, which can feel overwhelming. <br><br><strong>Fortunately, technology has revolutionized how we save and back up our data.<br></strong><br>Most photo backup devices&nbsp;now automatically locate, organize, and save your photos and videos while also removing duplicates.&nbsp;Unfortunately, however, many options&nbsp;out there either overcomplicate things, don’t deliver, or try to squeeze you into never-ending subscriptions. We've tried them all—cloud services, external drives, you name it. <br><br>Here are a few things to consider before making your final purchase:<br></p><ul style="--pf-line-spacing-xs:10px;--pf-line-spacing-sm:10px;--pf-line-spacing-md:10px;--pf-line-spacing-lg:10px;--pf-text-indent-xs:0px;--pf-text-indent-sm:0px;--pf-text-indent-md:0px;--pf-text-indent-lg:0px" data-pf-type="List2" class="sc-djVWQC gSkqPQ pf-341_"><li data-pf-type="List2.Item2" class="sc-epRwmx foIZBL pf-342_">How many files can be stored?<br></li><li data-pf-type="List2.Item2" class="sc-epRwmx foIZBL pf-344_">Does it work with all of your devices? iOS, Android, Windows, and&nbsp;macOS</li><li data-pf-type="List2.Item2" class="sc-epRwmx foIZBL pf-346_">How easy is it to complete file&nbsp;backups each time?</li><li data-pf-type="List2.Item2" class="sc-epRwmx foIZBL pf-348_">Which file types can be selected and backed up?</li><li data-pf-type="List2.Item2" class="sc-epRwmx foIZBL pf-350_">How secure will your photos be? Can hackers access&nbsp;your private files?</li></ul><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-352_" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">Each of the backup devices we tested promised security, but in the end, they always left our team members a little&nbsp;worried. <strong>This is why ThePhotoStick Omni always&nbsp;ranked above the others on our list.</strong><br></p></div></div></div></div></div><div data-section-id="pf-dba2" data-pf-type="Section" class="sc-pKreJ kztRcD pf-354_"><div style="--cw:950px" class="sc-djTQO