51&width=768 768w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/files/TPSO_Smiling_Customer.png?v=1718665551&width=1024 1024w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/files/TPSO_Smiling_Customer.png?v=1718665551&width=1280 1280w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/files/TPSO_Smiling_Customer.png?v=1718665551&width=1440 1440w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/files/TPSO_Smiling_Customer.png?v=1718665551&width=1680 1680w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/files/TPSO_Smiling_Customer.png?v=1718665551&width=1800 1800w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/files/TPSO_Smiling_Customer.png?v=1718665551&width=1920 1920w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/files/TPSO_Smiling_Customer.png?v=1718665551&width=2048 2048w" fetchPriority="low" decoding="async" loading="lazy" style="--pf-image-ratio:0.8" width="1920" height="2400" sizes="75vw" data-pf-type="Image4" class="sc-ezrfit jWdAoc pf-397_" store="[object Object]"/></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:6;--c-md:6;--c-lg:6"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-fscnvs bOiGIg pf-398_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-iLsJvT gbBbPZ pf-399_">Reason #4</h3><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-401_" data-pf-type="Paragraph3"><strong>You Can Backup your photos anywhere, anytime—No Wi-Fi or internet connection needed.<br></strong><br>Unlike&nbsp;external hard drives, most photo backup sticks can fit right in your pocket. No matter how stuffed your backpack is or how skinny your jeans are, you can carry your backup stick anywhere you go.<br><br>Take ThePhotoStick Omni on your next family vacation and easily back up your favorite photos and videos each night, ensuring you never lose a single memory. </p></div></div></div><div class="sc-bmzXxz iAfMPC pf-403_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:8px;--s-sm:15px;position:relative" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:6;--c-md:6;--c-lg:6"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-fscnvs bOiGIg pf-404_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-iLsJvT gbBbPZ pf-405_">Reason #5</h3><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-407_" data-pf-type="Paragraph3"><strong>You'll never worry about water damage, stolen devices, or losing files in the cloud again.<br></strong><br>Top-notch photo backup sticks work with almost any major computer or mobile operating systems.<br><br>ThePhotoStick Omni stands out from other photo backup sticks because of its specialized adapter. The Omni adapter is compatible with Android, iOS, Windows, and MacOS.  </p></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:6;--c-md:6;--c-lg:6"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-fscnvs bOiGIg pf-409_"><img alt="LP Assets (31).png__PID:bdd53ac2-64ff-43a8-92f1-f1f9b49d59d4" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/files/LP_Assets_31.png?v=1719359344&width=2048" srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/files/LP_Assets_31.png?v=1719359344&width=375 375w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/files/LP_Assets_31.png?v=1719359344&width=550 550w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/files/LP_Assets_31.png?v=1719359344&width=768 768w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/files/LP_Assets_31.png?v=1719359344&width=1024 1024w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/files/LP_Assets_31.png?v=1719359344&width=1280 1280w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/files/LP_Assets_31.png?v=1719359344&width=1440 1440w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/files/LP_Assets_31.png?v=1719359344&width=1680 1680w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/files/LP_Assets_31.png?v=1719359344&width=1800 1800w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/files/LP_Assets_31.png?v=1719359344&width=1920 1920w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/files/LP_Assets_31.png?v=1719359344&width=2048 2048w" fetchPriority="low" decoding="async" loading="lazy" style="--pf-image-ratio:1.0867924528301887" width="1152" height="1060" sizes="75vw" data-pf-type="Image4" class="sc-ezrfit jWdAoc pf-410_" store="[object Object]"/></div></div></div></div></div><div data-section-id="pf-a1d0" data-category="FAQs" data-name="Coco" data-pf-type="Section" class="sc-pKreJ kztRcD pf-411_"><div style="--cw:950px" class="sc-djTQOc ejtSSi"><div class="sc-bmzXxz iAfMPC pf-412_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px;position:relative" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-fscnvs bOiGIg pf-413_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-iLsJvT gbBbPZ pf-414_">Frequently Asked Questions</h3></div></div></div><div class="sc-bmzXxz iAfMPC pf-416_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px;position:relative" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-fscnvs bOiGIg pf-417_"><div class="sc-dExXmK dxVHbk pf-418_ pf-icon-right" data-scrolling="false" data-multiple="false" data-pf-type="Accordion"><div data-pf-type="Accordion.Content.Wrapper" class="sc-iapVNj kZpFRP pf-419_"><button type="button" class="sc-lnPyOc fMRkED pf-420_ pf-anchor" data-header-id="5b6b4071-b469-4c01-adc7-02d514fb1025" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion.Header"><i class="pfa pfa-chevron-right pfa-arrow"></i><span>Is ThePhotoStick® Omni easy to use?</span></button><div data-pf-expandable="true" data-id="5b6b4071-b469-4c01-adc7-02d514fb1025" style="display:none" data-pf-type="Accordion.Content" class="sc-eulNPF hByIKx pf-422_"><div class="sc-bmzXxz iAfMPC pf-423_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px;position:relative" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-fscnvs bOiGIg pf-424_"><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-425_" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">Yes, getting started with ThePhotoStick Omni is incredibly easy! Please note, however, that it will take some time for ThePhotoStick Omni to find each of your photos and safely back them up. This time can vary depending on how many photos you have, the size of your files, and the type of device you are using. But the great thing about ThePhotoStick Omni is that anyone can use it, no matter how comfortable they are with technology!</p></div></div></div></div></div><div data-pf-type="Accordion.Content.Wrapper" class="sc-iapVNj kZpFRP pf-427_"><button type="button" class="sc-lnPyOc fMRkED pf-428_ pf-anchor" data-header-id="afa31b68-ab08-403f-aa16-dd6bca9aa26f" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion.Header"><i class="pfa pfa-chevron-right pfa-arrow"></i><span>Which devices work with ThePhotoStick® Omni?</span></button><div data-pf-expandable="true" data-id="afa31b68-ab08-403f-aa16-dd6bca9aa26f" style="display:none" data-pf-type="Accordion.Content" class="sc-eulNPF hByIKx pf-430_"><div class="sc-bmzXxz iAfMPC pf-431_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px;position:relative" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-fscnvs bOiGIg pf-432_"><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-433_" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">ThePhotoStick® Omni works with all modern computers, smartphones, tablets, and computers right out of the box.It's also compatible with all Windows, Android, and Mac Operating Systems:<br><br>- Windows: Windows 7 SP1 and newer<br>- Apple: iOS and iPadOS 13.0 and Later<br>- Android: 8.0 and later</p></div></div></div></div></div><div data-pf-type="Accordion.Content.Wrapper" class="sc-iapVNj kZpFRP pf-435_"><button type="button" class="sc-lnPyOc fMRkED pf-436_ pf-anchor" data-header-id="f5004916-c340-4f32-a701-bde3d3196a9d" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion.Header"><i class="pfa pfa-chevron-right pfa-arrow"></i><span>Which version of ThePhotoStick® Omni should I choose?</span></button><div data-pf-expandable="true" data-id="f5004916-c340-4f32-a701-bde3d3196a9d" style="display:none" data-pf-type="Accordion.Content" class="sc-eulNPF hByIKx pf-438_"><div class="sc-bmzXxz iAfMPC pf-439_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px;position:relative" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-fscnvs bOiGIg pf-440_"><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-441_" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">This depends on how many photos and videos you have.<br><br>- The 128GB version can hold up to 51,200 photos and videos, which will be plenty for most people.<br><br>- The 256GB version holds up to roughly 102,400 photos and videos, giving you all the storage you'll ever need, perfect for large families with lots of memories.</p></div></div></div></div></div><div data-pf-type="Accordion.Content.Wrapper" class="sc-iapVNj kZpFRP pf-443_"><button type="button" class="sc-lnPyOc fMRkED pf-444_ pf-anchor" data-header-id="52afadff-6473-4b65-b5c7-b6a7a1c0b587" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion.Header"><i class="pfa pfa-chevron-right pfa-arrow"></i><span>How many photos can I store on ThePhotoStick® Omni?</span></button><div data-pf-expandable="true" data-id="52afadff-6473-4b65-b5c7-b6a7a1c0b587" style="display:none" data-pf-type="Accordion.Content" class="sc-eulNPF hByIKx pf-446_"><div class="sc-bmzXxz iAfMPC pf-447_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px;position:relative" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-fscnvs bOiGIg pf-448_"><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-449_" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">Approximate Number of Photos Stored on ThePhotoStick USB:32GB - 12,800 photos<br><br>•&nbsp;64GB - 25,600 photos<br>•&nbsp;128GB - 51,200 photos<br>•&nbsp;256GB - 102,400 photos<br>•&nbsp;512GB - 204,800 photos</p></div></div></div></div></div><div data-pf-type="Accordion.Content.Wrapper" class="sc-iapVNj kZpFRP pf-451_"><button type="button" class="sc-lnPyOc fMRkED pf-452_ pf-anchor" data-header-id="50b59a5c-000a-4a45-b7ac-4bdd4f22116c" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion.Header"><i class="pfa pfa-chevron-right pfa-arrow"></i><span>Can I use ThePhotoStick® Omni as an ongoing backup solution?</span></button><div data-pf-expandable="true" data-id="50b59a5c-000a-4a45-b7ac-4bdd4f22116c" style="display:none" data-pf-type="Accordion.Content" class="sc-eulNPF hByIKx pf-454_"><div class="sc-bmzXxz iAfMPC pf-455_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px;position:relative" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-fscnvs bOiGIg pf-456_"><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-457_" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">Yes, it’s a great backup solution! Many people leave the ThePhotoStick Omni plugged in and do a weekly backup to make sure they are continually protecting their memories.</p></div></div></div></div></div><div data-pf-type="Accordion.Content.Wrapper" class="sc-iapVNj kZpFRP pf-459_"><button type="button" class="sc-lnPyOc fMRkED pf-460_ pf-anchor" data-header-id="b01e9e23-32d2-432b-9c7b-686b75477eee" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion.Header"><i class="pfa pfa-chevron-right pfa-arrow"></i><span>Does ThePhotoStick® Omni need to install anything on my computer?</span></button><div data-pf-expandable="true" data-id="b01e9e23-32d2-432b-9c7b-686b75477eee" style="display:none" data-pf-type="Accordion.Content" class="sc-eulNPF hByIKx pf-462_"><div class="sc-bmzXxz iAfMPC pf-463_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px;position:relative" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-fscnvs bOiGIg pf-464_"><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-465_" data-pf-type="Paragraph3"><b>For computers (Mac or PC):<br></b>ThePhotoStick® Omni does not need to install anything on your computer, nor does it require anything to be already installed on your computer.<br><br>It comes with everything it needs. Just simply plug it into an available USB slot, and you’re ready to get started.<br><br><b>For phones (Android or iOS):<br></b>ThePhotoStick® Omni offers a FREE app that allows you to back up, view, and organize your photos with ease.<br><br>There are no monthly charges or download 